      "status": "SUPERSEDED \u2014 discarded attempts retained as chronological evidence",
      "why": "Attempted twice on 2026-08-01 and both runs were discarded as untrustworthy. The first competed with a concurrent audit agent; the second, intended as a clean control, came back WORSE (interactive median 2221ms vs the contaminated run's 1821ms) with a 5733ms backend-ready outlier and a 1901-3604ms spread. A second reading worse than a contaminated one falsifies the regression reading and indicates machine state, not added startup work. Owner confirmed the host was running many concurrent subagents throughout.",
