      "structural_evidence_in_lieu": "Flag-off executes no plugin code at all, which is a stronger claim than any timing measurement: tests/plugins-startup-unchanged.test.js inspects require.cache to prove nothing under services/plugins/ loads, that the registered IPC channel set is byte-identical to a control run, and that userData is never even resolved. The only flag-off deltas are one already-cached require, 8 additional preload bridge descriptors, and ~50 renderer lines.",
